<p>Halflings have one of the most powerful military forces in the known world and have been at war with most other races for thousands of years.</p><p>Removes <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 5, 6</acronym> stun, daze, or pin effects and grants immunity to stuns, dazes and pins for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 5, 6</acronym> turns.</p>